[node name="Text" type="Label" parent="Credits/Panel/VBox" unique_id=284848674]
custom_minimum_size = Vector2(760, 0)
layout_mode = 2
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 15
theme_override_colors/font_color = Color(0.92, 0.94, 0.97, 1)
theme_override_colors/font_outline_color = Color(0, 0, 0, 0.85)
theme_override_constants/outline_size = 3
text = "Credits

Winter War: Summa – a prototype made with the Godot Engine (godotengine.org).

3D models (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0)
These models are used under the CC-BY 4.0 licence
(http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Their textures were made smaller for
the game; the models are otherwise unchanged.

- \"Mosin Nagant M91\" by Doink
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/mosin-nagant-m91-55c00242c4024307a761a89167e39a7c
- \"Suomi KP-31\" by soidev
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/suomi-kp-31-7e5a00199276485b96b4749f68a0a9a0
- \"Machine Gun Maxim\" by jezusek
  https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/machine-gun-maxim-c3be4e0b9ddc4297a8356852b21bdc37

Sounds (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0)
- \"Lentokone, potkurikone, syöksy, ylilento / An old aeroplane, old propeller aircraft, Viima,
  a 1939 model training plane, approaching, diving over low\" by YleArkisto
  https://freesound.org/s/254511/ – shortened and made mono for the game.

- \"Artillery Barrage\" by Mozfoo, made from an explosion by Steveygos93
  https://freesound.org/s/486086/ – made mono and a little quieter for the game.

Photographs (Creative Commons Attribution 4.0)
- Wartime photographs from the Finnish Wartime Photograph Archive: **SA-kuva**
  (https://sa-kuva.fi/), used under CC BY 4.0. Shown on the day screen between waves; made
  smaller and greyscale for the game. Photos: 144607, 144608, 144612, a_8, a_123, a_125,
  a_126, a_128, a_129, a_511.

Font
- \"FreeMono Bold\" from GNU FreeFont (https://savannah.gnu.org/projects/freefont/), used for the
  front-report telegrams. GNU GPL v3 with the font exception – see
  `assets/fonts/FreeFont-LICENSE.txt`.

Everything else
Terrain, trees, textures, sounds and soldiers are generated by the project's own scripts."
autowrap_mode = 3

